###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Cleavage-energy errors are in meV/A^2 (energy per area), which has no unit individual; mlips:hasUnit is omitted and the unit is in the labels. The DFT database (PBE, 550 eV) is the authors' earlier work and is not re-described.
# - Checkpoint versions beyond the names of Table 1 are not given; only MatterSim-v1 is linked to a registry model. SevenNet-MF-OMPA applies NequIP by the registry convention; AlphaNet is a new registry method.
# - Single-point times are per slab of varying size, so no per-atom time is derived.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/mehdizadeh2025.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.

